The bug in [`SimplexTableau.java`](file:///Users/nothing/prometheus_workdir_microstudy/math_33_group_a_blind/src/main/java/org/apache/commons/math3/optimization/linear/SimplexTableau.java#L338) was caused by using `maxUlps` rather than `epsilon` in `dropPhase1Objective()` when checking if non-artificial variables have a positive cost to drop after Phase 1:

```java
// Before:
if (Precision.compareTo(entry, 0d, maxUlps) > 0) {
    columnsToDrop.add(i);
}

// After:
if (Precision.compareTo(entry, 0d, epsilon) > 0) {
    columnsToDrop.add(i);
}
